In this drawer we store blitzlibs, that are currently not used for different reasons.

ElmoreSysLib:   only "Request" is available, this Call is almost the same as rimisclib/EZRequest an can be substituted.
LotanSystem:    moved commands KickVersion/execbase to environlib, New/Dispose to banklib, CtrlC to RIMiscLib
LotanC2P:       no documentation about that single c2p-routine, so ....
FuzziesReqLib:  not used as it relays on a very old requester library "req.library", it is advised to use reqtools or os-builtin requesters
RIReqLib:       not used as it relays on a very old requester library "req.library", it is advised to use reqtools or os-builtin requesters  
RILVCallHook:   only command "RetrieceCallHook moved into gadtoolslib
RIListLib:      The lib was in alpha stage and it is not suggested to use it
RomulusReqLib:  replaced by easyreqlib
NeilsSupportLib:not used since years, command IsEven/SearchString moved to RIMiscLib
QuickLib:       the multiply/division-routines have been implemented into AmiBlitz3s standard lmulib/ldivlib and will be used on OPTIMIZE 1
                QPlot has been integrated into scrollib
                WLimit/WRap has been integrated into vallib
                the c2p routines are about 50% slower than the routines in chunkylib and can easily be substituted
